                    <!-- Core Concept -->
                    <h2 id="core-concept" class="text-xl text-white font-bold mt-6 border-b border-white/10 pb-2">1. The Core Difference: Destination vs Direction</h2>
                    <p>In dono words mein basic difference <strong>"Manzil" (Destination)</strong> aur <strong>"Disha" (Direction)</strong> ka hai.</p>
                    
                    <ul class="space-y-3 pl-2">
