                        <li><strong class="text-white">A. Physical Movement & Actions</strong>
                            <p class="text-sm mt-1 text-gray-400">Agar journey complete hoti dikhani hai toh 'to', agar process dikhana hai toh 'toward'.</p>
                            <div class="bg-white/5 p-3 rounded-lg mt-2 text-sm text-gray-400 border border-white/5">
                                <span class="text-white block">"He ran <strong>to</strong> the finish line."</span> (Usne race complete ki, line cross ki.)<br>
